libcbor0.10:amd64[[debgraph magic comma]]
libc6 (>= 2.14)[[debgraph magic comma]]
library for parsing and generating CBOR (RFC 7049)[[debgraph magic comma]]
[[debgraph magic comma]]
library for parsing and generating CBOR (RFC 7049)
 CBOR is a general-purpose schema-less binary data format, defined in
 RFC 7049. This package provides a C library for parsing and generating
 CBOR. The main features are:
 .
  - Complete RFC conformance
  - Robust C99 implementation
  - Layered architecture offers both control and convenience
  - Flexible memory management
  - No shared global state - threading friendly
  - Proper handling of UTF-8
  - Full support for streams & incremental processing
  - Extensive documentation and test suite
  - No runtime dependencies, small footprint
 .
 This package contains the runtime library.[[debgraph magic comma]]
