 libgcrypt contains cryptographic functions.  Many important free
 ciphers, hash algorithms and public key signing algorithms have been
 implemented:
 .
 AES, Arcfour, Blowfish, Camellia, CAST5, ChaCha20 DES, GOST28147,
 Salsa20, SEED, Serpent, Twofish, ECB, CFB, CBC, OFB, CTR, CCM, GCM, OCB,
 POLY1305, AESWRAP, MD2, MD4, MD5, GOST R 34.11, RIPE-MD160, SHA-1,
 SHA2-224, SHA2-256, SHA2-384, SHA2-512, SHA3-224, SHA3-256, SHA3-384,
 SHA3-512, SHAKE-128, SHAKE-256, TIGER-192, Whirlpool, HMAC, CMAC,
 GMAC-AES, GMAC-CAMELLIA, GMAC-TWOFISH, GMAC-SERPENT, GMAC-SEED,
 Poly1305, Poly1305-AES, Poly1305-CAMELLIA, Poly1305-TWOFISH,
 Poly1305-SERPENT, Poly1305-SEED, RSA, Elgamal, DSA, ECDSA, EdDSA, ECDH,
 ML-DSA, ML-KEM, SNTRUP761, Classic McEliece[[debgraph magic comma]]
